.DS_Store
*.log
node_modules/
docs/brainstorm/
docs/plan/
docs/reviews/
docs/hotfix-review/
docs/code-review/
docs/debriefs/
evals/results/

# A multi-turn run writes its session transcript back into the case directory, as
# `<session-uuid>.jsonl` beside the input and as a `<session-uuid>/subagents/` tree below it.
# The input is history.jsonl; everything else there is a run artifact.
#
# Match the artifact by name, at any depth. An earlier `evals/*/*/*/` matched by depth and
# swallowed the graders/ of every case git did not already track — four cases were committed
# without the graders that score them.
evals/*/*/*.jsonl
!evals/*/*/history.jsonl
evals/**/subagents/
evals/*/*/[0-9a-f]*-[0-9a-f]*-[0-9a-f]*-[0-9a-f]*-[0-9a-f]*/
